    affiliation: "Department of Artificial Intelligence Convergence, Chonnam National University, Gwangju, Republic of Korea"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/huulocmedvnu/sample_sufficiency_calculator"
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - perturbation screens
  - sample size
  - experimental design
  - directional statistics
abstract: >-
  Closed-form calculation of the number of treated cells needed to estimate the direction of a
  perturbation effect in a shared single-cell embedding to a chosen angular tolerance, accounting
  for the size of the control pool. Includes calibration pipelines for four public perturbation
  atlases, a verification suite and Lean 4 proofs of the deterministic core.
